  "query": "-- Revoking twice keeps the first revocation time.\n-- $1: token id, $2: now\nUPDATE tokens SET revoked_at = coalesce(revoked_at, $2)\nWHERE id = $1\nRETURNING id, name, scope, workflow_id, trigger_id, created_at, last_used_at, revoked_at\n",
